         Support for importing modules was added, along with deterministic
         handling for ambiguous cases.
 
+.. function:: qualname(obj)
+
+    .. versionadded:: 6.2
+
+    Returns the fully qualified dotted path of a class or function, including
+    its module. Raises :exc:`TypeError` if ``obj`` is not a class or function.
+    For example::
+
+        >>> from django.utils.module_loading import qualname
+        >>> from django.core.exceptions import ValidationError
+        >>> qualname(ValidationError)
+        'django.core.exceptions.ValidationError'
+
 ``django.utils.safestring``
